//! ihs_wl_server: an embedded Wayland server (smithay) that hands each client
//! toplevel's surfaces to ivi-homescreen as zero-copy platform-view layers.
//! The shell is the only compositor; this module never renders.
//!
//! This file is the C ABI (`include/ihs_wl.h`, generated by cbindgen). Same
//! boundary rules as ihs_shared: C types only, `struct_size` first, integer
//! result codes, and a thread-local `ihs_wl_last_error()`. Every entry point
//! catches panics -- one must never unwind into the shell.

